From 5524351c303d34b9fcf104129342ec66b9befba7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 17:57:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace solution catalog rows with full-image product cards

Each of the 10 catalog products now renders as a single expressive
hero image (1024x1024 WebP) with the product name composited over a
dark gradient wash, mixing a classic serif treatment for the Arabic
name with a bold modern accent for its trailing numeral. Replaces the
small ProductMark thumbnail + text row layout in the main index grid
(ProductMark itself is kept for the detail modal header).

- src/config/storeSolutionCatalog.ts: add cardImageSrc field +
  solutionCatalogCardImageSrc() helper, wired for all 10 products.
- src/components/store/catalog/SolutionCatalogProductCard.tsx: new
  full-image card component (Vite + React Router, no next/image).
- src/components/store/catalog/SolutionCatalogApp.tsx: swap the row
  list for a responsive card grid using the new component.
- src/styles/storeSolutionCatalog.css: add card/grid styles, remove
  the now-unused .solution-catalog__row rules.
- public/images/store/catalog/cards/{code}.webp: the 10 hero images.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CS3kM5Gn7fEW2cLySFb6PG
